{
    "word": "congeries",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "b20b393e-07fb-37e2-b41f-08b5dac4540c",
                "word": "congeries",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "5369f5b0-f2b0-4a8d-9e52-31c608cca2d6",
                        "entry_id": "b20b393e-07fb-37e2-b41f-08b5dac4540c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "congeries"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "57e8293c-adb1-3cd7-bb65-0b3702cbe059",
                        "entry_id": "b20b393e-07fb-37e2-b41f-08b5dac4540c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A collection or aggregation of disparate items."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fdefbe12-d874-4741-bc68-53de1c1d0f7c",
                                "sense_id": "57e8293c-adb1-3cd7-bb65-0b3702cbe059",
                                "text": "And when the Newtonian philosophy gained ground in Europe, it was the opinion of Cotes rather than that of Newton that became most prevalent, till at last Boscovich propounded his theory, that matter is a congeries of mathematical points..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "59f6ac8a-8dd2-4fc9-a143-1baa19cba992",
                                "sense_id": "57e8293c-adb1-3cd7-bb65-0b3702cbe059",
                                "text": "The world has seen the postal system developed from a congeries of independent and exclusive services into a well-ordered union, of which all countries enjoy the manifold benefits."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dac6863a-c85e-4835-8079-09d9506705b2",
                                "sense_id": "57e8293c-adb1-3cd7-bb65-0b3702cbe059",
                                "text": "I have always taken a lively interest in this singular oasis of comparative civilization and organized society, set in the midst of a congeries of barbarous peoples, over whom its rulers exercise an authority which, if scarcely approaching the settled polity of more advanced communities, is at least in the direction of peace and order."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f01314a-4832-45d2-ab10-7c23196fc42d",
                                "sense_id": "57e8293c-adb1-3cd7-bb65-0b3702cbe059",
                                "text": "By short cuts known to him, he made his way now through the vast congeries of rooms and staircases to the banqueting-hall, five acres distant on the other side of the house."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e61ec856-1931-4c54-98b4-cc8924ba4d3b",
                                "sense_id": "57e8293c-adb1-3cd7-bb65-0b3702cbe059",
                                "text": "Two of the less irrelevantly moving things - a rather large congeries of iridescent, prolately spheroidal bubbles and a very much smaller polyhedron of unknown colours and rapidly shifting surface angles - seemed to take notice of him and follow him about or float ahead as he changed position..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c793a05e-7f17-4726-805b-b44385bd6381",
                                "sense_id": "57e8293c-adb1-3cd7-bb65-0b3702cbe059",
                                "text": "When Washtucna Coulee could not contain the great surge, floodwaters rose to make one of the most significant records on the entire plateau. In two places, they topped the divide between the nearly parallel preglacial Palouse and Snake valleys, crossing it to enter the Snake Canyon. They swept away a loessial cover more than 100 feet thick from 80 square miles of summit area and scored the basalt thus exposed into a congeries of canyons, cataracts, and rock basin."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "54e1ca51-bcc4-409b-8286-d26cad8657e4",
                                "sense_id": "57e8293c-adb1-3cd7-bb65-0b3702cbe059",
                                "text": "The three of them could hardly tell themselves apart, became a sort of congeries of loving emotions, all mutually complementary."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eae616bc-0c76-4a7e-bc2c-789358a5f1db",
                                "sense_id": "57e8293c-adb1-3cd7-bb65-0b3702cbe059",
                                "text": "That whole congeries of values was now in question."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fc202eb1-2435-4f85-956f-5891950e9cdd",
                                "sense_id": "57e8293c-adb1-3cd7-bb65-0b3702cbe059",
                                "text": "It was not what I was that I disliked, I mean the singular, essential me - although I grant that even the notion of an essential, singular self is problematic - but the congeries of affects, inclinations, received ideas, class tics, that my birth and upbringing had bestowed on me in place of a personality."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "25c350ad-5f0e-4c01-b100-baabf8c09ea7",
                                "sense_id": "57e8293c-adb1-3cd7-bb65-0b3702cbe059",
                                "text": "Where once it [the British royal family] was an organising hub of national accumulation and a centre of political power, now—as well, of course, as a congeries of extraordinarily wealthy rentiers—it's a farcical and profitable commodity for the culture industry, and an invaluable component of authoritarian national mythology."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6ad74856-4cab-4d27-bf28-64f687c8ce3a",
                        "source_entry_id": "b20b393e-07fb-37e2-b41f-08b5dac4540c",
                        "source_sense_id": "57e8293c-adb1-3cd7-bb65-0b3702cbe059",
                        "source_sense_description": "A collection or aggregation of disparate items",
                        "target_lang_word": "Ansammlung",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Ansammlung",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c3d1cc09-fcf9-382d-8ed4-4e83d11aaca8",
                                        "entry_id": "2cae22ea-8de2-3c2c-a29f-514e50fa5858",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "eine Menge unbestimmter Anzahl"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9fa38605-74e2-47c0-8d3d-4c9255757cf8",
                                                "sense_id": "c3d1cc09-fcf9-382d-8ed4-4e83d11aaca8",
                                                "text": "Es war eine Ansammlung der Menschen zu beobachten."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf5a2ef4-03fd-468e-b207-a2aee377f15b",
                                                "sense_id": "c3d1cc09-fcf9-382d-8ed4-4e83d11aaca8",
                                                "text": "In der Astronomie sind oft Ansammlungen von Sternen zu beobachten."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "149b911d-b71c-421b-af8c-47f59c10660b",
                                                "sense_id": "c3d1cc09-fcf9-382d-8ed4-4e83d11aaca8",
                                                "text": "„Doch sie hat eine Aufgabe, die bedroht ist, und diese Aufgabe der Universität ist es, die meine Existenz in dieser Ansammlung praktischer Leute rechtfertigt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1673dae4-3dbc-4be4-b046-a26ab762de36",
                                                "sense_id": "c3d1cc09-fcf9-382d-8ed4-4e83d11aaca8",
                                                "text": "„Das Hotel besteht aus einer Ansammlung unterschiedlich großer Lehmwürfel.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "547cf3ba-05d3-4b28-8120-08123864bb76",
                                                "sense_id": "c3d1cc09-fcf9-382d-8ed4-4e83d11aaca8",
                                                "text": "„Unter ihm lag der Sandstrand, rechts von der Mündung und einer Ansammlung von Felsbrocken begrenzt, die zur Hälfte vom Meer bedeckt waren und wie eine Gruppe ruhender Amphibien aussahen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ba5c6a7f-e087-4a83-a94c-a194e5639ac2",
                        "source_entry_id": "b20b393e-07fb-37e2-b41f-08b5dac4540c",
                        "source_sense_id": "57e8293c-adb1-3cd7-bb65-0b3702cbe059",
                        "source_sense_description": "A collection or aggregation of disparate items",
                        "target_lang_word": "Anhäufung",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Anhäufung",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "45ab5f59-653c-36eb-bc07-2d2ecb91d52a",
                                        "entry_id": "71f7d8cb-4a72-3a67-a5bf-194b6e94fe7b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "die Bildung eines Haufens"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba109851-45fd-4ea3-94cb-f6457e264eb0",
                                                "sense_id": "45ab5f59-653c-36eb-bc07-2d2ecb91d52a",
                                                "text": "Durch den Ausfall der Müllabfuhr war die Anhäufung von Müll vor den Häusern ein gewohnter Anblick."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ecd6d50e-054a-3791-8c9f-c7bbd5f33b4a",
                                        "entry_id": "71f7d8cb-4a72-3a67-a5bf-194b6e94fe7b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "im übertragenen Sinn: große Ansammlung"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a09286f-81c9-43d3-acc8-0600aa82938b",
                                                "sense_id": "ecd6d50e-054a-3791-8c9f-c7bbd5f33b4a",
                                                "text": "Die Bundesrepublik muss auf eine weitere Anhäufung von Schulden verzichten."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "68ede17f-bc45-3916-bd3f-13281244929f",
                                        "entry_id": "71f7d8cb-4a72-3a67-a5bf-194b6e94fe7b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(normalerweise bewusst erzeugter) Haufen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9a47c73-5840-4682-9aca-0c10eef881d9",
                                                "sense_id": "68ede17f-bc45-3916-bd3f-13281244929f",
                                                "text": "Von weitem waren die Anhäufungen der Mineralien zu sehen."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d0885f40-56ce-486f-8059-6f707a100ca4",
                        "source_entry_id": "b20b393e-07fb-37e2-b41f-08b5dac4540c",
                        "source_sense_id": "57e8293c-adb1-3cd7-bb65-0b3702cbe059",
                        "source_sense_description": "A collection or aggregation of disparate items",
                        "target_lang_word": "Komplex",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Komplex",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b9e5bf0a-0b55-3bd7-8ada-7d066a547945",
                                        "entry_id": "66d11fe0-84d0-3184-af97-c7528e7642ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Menge von Einzelheiten, die miteinander verbunden sind und zusammen das Ganze ausmachen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db4a253b-e691-476d-a874-abba9a9a5dd1",
                                                "sense_id": "b9e5bf0a-0b55-3bd7-8ada-7d066a547945",
                                                "text": "Bis zum Beginn der neuen Saison muss ein ganzer Komplex von Aufgaben bewältigt werden."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d3f0648-0e7d-4d5d-bc05-2468e451164a",
                                                "sense_id": "b9e5bf0a-0b55-3bd7-8ada-7d066a547945",
                                                "text": "„Er kann aus dem Wortschatz herausgelöste Komplexe untersuchen, deren Zusammengehörigkeit und Entwicklung auf Grundmotive und rekonstruierte Grundformen erläuternd zurückführen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "af5180c8-aa2a-3295-8594-7a0550703bae",
                                        "entry_id": "66d11fe0-84d0-3184-af97-c7528e7642ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "zusammenhängende Gruppe, insbesondere von Gebäuden"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa8efd67-e9a8-4387-a99a-9f1511e71ba0",
                                                "sense_id": "af5180c8-aa2a-3295-8594-7a0550703bae",
                                                "text": "Ein einziger Immobilienhai besitzt den ganzen Komplex rund um den Marktplatz."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a59ec64-42f6-4d36-91c9-4267ccafc2b7",
                                                "sense_id": "af5180c8-aa2a-3295-8594-7a0550703bae",
                                                "text": "„Als Haftort wurde der riesige Komplex des Spandauer Gefängnisses eingerichtet, wo sich die Siegermächte im monatlichen Wechsel bei der Bewachung ablösten.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "66c6c045-a123-3ebf-b0eb-3bb126860d8e",
                                        "entry_id": "66d11fe0-84d0-3184-af97-c7528e7642ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ins Unterbewusstsein verdrängte Gruppe von Vorstellungen oder nicht verarbeiteten Erlebnissen, die zu dauernder Beunruhigung führen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ca80821-72a4-4769-8849-409a9af6317e",
                                                "sense_id": "66c6c045-a123-3ebf-b0eb-3bb126860d8e",
                                                "text": "Er steckt so voller Komplexe, dass er sich kaum unter Menschen zu gehen traut."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "782af7bf-a0f2-4fa7-9ebc-40f632ecad44",
                                                "sense_id": "66c6c045-a123-3ebf-b0eb-3bb126860d8e",
                                                "text": "„Lachmnn hatte einen Komplex,weil er hinkte.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7a0f9204-2a73-38f8-94e2-d6c01d8e2435",
                                        "entry_id": "66d11fe0-84d0-3184-af97-c7528e7642ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "eine bestimmte chemische Verbindung"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4bef2527-1d21-499b-8d32-2c126171f18f",
                                                "sense_id": "7a0f9204-2a73-38f8-94e2-d6c01d8e2435",
                                                "text": "Über die Komplexe in der Chemie kann man sich unter dem Stichwort „Einführung in die Komplexchemie“ informieren."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"4\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "da5de8b7-ac5d-309e-9d1a-4fe31b495859",
                                        "entry_id": "66d11fe0-84d0-3184-af97-c7528e7642ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "eine mathematische Struktur"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe7aaae2-d15e-4712-a42a-35f54f057d4a",
                                                "sense_id": "da5de8b7-ac5d-309e-9d1a-4fe31b495859",
                                                "text": "Ein geometrischer Komplex ist eine endliche Menge, ein algebraischer Komplex hingegen, ist keine Menge."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"5\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
